# RockHawk core

RockHawk is an independently designed local attorney-assistance review tool.
It is conceptually comparable to enterprise review tables, but branding, UI,
copy, prompts, and code must remain original. Do not copy Harvey (or other
vendor) trade dress, product names, screenshots, or prompt text.

The product is **not** an autonomous legal decision-maker. AI output is a
draft for a licensed attorney. Preserve human-review floors (verified cells,
QC, audit).

Stack: FastAPI + SQLAlchemy backend, React + TypeScript frontend, Postgres
(or SQLite in tests), Redis jobs, local object storage. Prefer extending this
stack over rewriting.

Preserve multi-file / folder upload and the expanded ingestion allowlist
(`.pdf .docx .txt .md .csv .xlsx .xls .htm .html .xml .pptx .ppt .jpg .jpeg
.png .vcf .vcard .rtf .eml .msg`).
